    The library's own metadata states:
      - "A markdown parser and compiler. Built for speed."
      - "License: MIT"


HOW IT IS USED
--------------

The HTML page (index.html) includes a <script> tag pointing to the jsDelivr
CDN. The library is used entirely on the client side to parse the markdown
text (release.body) returned by the GitHub Releases API and insert the
resulting HTML into the DOM.


